  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Musical Note.png|left|200px|Musical Note]]\nMusical Note is a type of [[Currencies|currency]] used to buy special prizes from the [[catalogue]]. It's part of the Birthday 2024 event.\n\nIt is unlocked at [[experience]] level 17.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Getting musical note'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.jpg|left|150 px|Riverboat]]\nEach boat during the event requires one type of [[:Category:Birthday Balloon Maker Products|balloon]] from the [[Birthday Balloon Maker|birthday balloon maker]]. Filling any box with a balloon gives you a certain amount of musical note.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Using musical note'''===\n{{Main|Catalogue}}\n[[File:Catalogue Front With Musical Note.png|150px|left|The catalogue]]\nMusical Note can be used to purchase items from the \"Fyne & Mysterious Gifts [[Catalogue]],\" found by clicking the blue post box at the end of the driveway. Different gifts have different prices.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Currencies]]\n[[Category:Catalogue]]\n\n{{Languages\n|es = Nota musical\n}}",
